00:47:47.480 --> 00:47:48.865
- With excellence.

00:47:48.865 --> 00:47:52.646
If you deploy yourself on a little thing,

00:47:52.646 --> 00:47:55.740
you may be excellent but
you sorta get no place.

00:47:55.740 --> 00:47:56.950
