00:48:50.455 --> 00:48:53.420
But then when I realized, oh,

00:48:53.420 --> 00:48:56.790
in the early days I was
betting on Mark and David

00:48:56.790 --> 00:48:59.680
and Jack and Ev as much as the idea.

00:48:59.680 --> 00:49:03.370
When they've hit, I started
realizing I was unbelievably

00:49:03.370 --> 00:49:06.210
consumer centric and I could
see things that would win.

00:49:06.210 --> 00:49:09.020
One of my biggest losses,
an app called Yobongo,

00:49:09.020 --> 00:49:12.093
