00:52:16.780 --> 00:52:18.379
- [Gary] That's a very good answer.

00:52:18.379 --> 00:52:19.870
Parting shot.

00:52:19.870 --> 00:52:23.040
Any last thought as we get out of here?

00:52:23.040 --> 00:52:24.640
- No.

00:52:24.640 --> 00:52:26.933
You know in terms of a parting shot,

00:52:28.468 --> 00:52:31.663
life can be really fantastic.

00:52:34.290 --> 00:52:38.440
But you have to have the
ability to always be focused

00:52:40.140 --> 00:52:43.180
