self awareness right now?

00:52:47.050 --> 00:52:52.050
- Pushes you so it's life
of lifetime learning.

00:52:52.613 --> 00:52:55.940
- How much do you think
humility is a key ingredient

00:52:55.940 --> 00:52:57.220
to this level of success?

00:52:57.220 --> 00:53:01.579
- I think humility comes with the volume

00:53:01.579 --> 00:53:05.898
of things that you do because
no matter how good you are

00:53:05.898 --> 00:53:07.793
as you ramp up the volume.

00:53:07.793 --> 00:53:08.917
- [Gary] Take a lot of L's.

00:53:08.917 --> 00:53:09.931
- You'll make mistakes.

00:53:09.931 --> 00:53:14.931
And so all of us who have
external success have had

00:53:17.358 --> 00:53:20.179
failures, misjudgments.

00:53:20.179 --> 00:53:25.002
And you shake your head
and say what a dummy am I.

00:53:25.002 --> 00:53:29.110
And it's the dummy
things, where you learn--

00:53:29.110 --> 00:53:30.689
- [Gary] It's the fun stuff I agree.

00:53:30.689 --> 00:53:34.670
Learning how not to beat
yourself up in those moments.

00:53:34.670 --> 00:53:38.220
- Well, you actually can't
beat yourself up 'cause

00:53:38.220 --> 00:53:41.555
