you have to rescue yourself

00:53:41.555 --> 00:53:43.101
from that stuff.

00:53:43.101 --> 00:53:45.140
That's where you learn.

00:53:45.140 --> 00:53:49.120
And driving to make things better.

00:53:49.120 --> 00:53:50.563
Make yourself better.

00:53:51.500 --> 00:53:55.950
Do things, almost like the ballet dancer.

00:53:55.950 --> 00:53:59.540
What is a perfect pattedoie look like?

00:53:59.540 --> 00:54:02.630
And imagining what those things could be

00:54:03.672 --> 00:54:05.763
and then going and creating them

00:54:05.763 --> 00:54:08.500
is what's lots of fun in life.

00:54:08.500 --> 00:54:10.700
- Vayner Nation, buy Steph's
book because I want him

00:54:10.700 --> 00:54:13.230
